        {
          "title": "粘土电路板",
          "content": "<p>电路板是电子产品的基础。</p>\n<p>一位国外网友，为了演示电路板并不是高深的产品，特别制作了一块粘土电路板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202509/bg2025091901.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>他把全过程的照片都放上网，先采集泥巴，然后将其压平。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202509/bg2025091902.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>在上面挖出电路，然后进行烧制。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202509/bg2025091903.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202509/bg2025091904.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>最后，装上铜线和电子元件，电路板就做好了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202509/bg2025091905.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202509/bg2025091906.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
